WEBVTT

00:08.808 --> 00:16.850
Shiroi mikazuki machi wo miorosu koro ni

00:16.850 --> 00:24.848
Aoi meikyuu kara mashou ga mezame-hajimeru

00:32.365 --> 00:36.169
Tsumibukai kono chijou de, boy

00:36.169 --> 00:39.172
Believing, dreaming

00:39.172 --> 00:43.009
Boku-tachi wa sagashiteru

00:43.009 --> 00:48.140
Tamashii no mezasubeki basho wo

00:49.949 --> 00:58.358
Ah, dore kurai fukai yami hikari ni kaetara

00:58.358 --> 01:02.929
Sekai no iro ga kawaru?

01:02.929 --> 01:05.598
Ah, itsuka kitto

01:05.598 --> 01:13.873
Ah, dore kurai fukai nazo ikutsumo toitara

01:13.873 --> 01:18.833
Rakuen no doa wa hiraku?

01:20.380 --> 01:27.013
Bokura no tabi wo start hajimeyou

02:01.754 --> 02:03.551
Poor thing.

02:05.792 --> 02:09.592
Go now, to where your heart desires.

02:34.354 --> 02:40.088
The 14th Night
Light Dog, Dark Dog, Black Dog

02:40.260 --> 02:42.095
You are the culprit!

02:42.095 --> 02:44.264
But how? How did you know it was me?!

02:44.264 --> 02:47.467
We followed the scent on this handkerchief
left at the scene of the crime

02:47.467 --> 02:49.435
and it led us to your room!

02:49.636 --> 02:50.603
Woof!

02:50.937 --> 02:53.906
We've found all the proof we need.
Now give yourself up!

02:54.274 --> 02:55.400
Damn!

02:56.142 --> 02:58.110
Good work! You're a fine dog.

02:58.178 --> 02:59.145
Woof, woof, woof!

02:59.379 --> 03:01.347
That's it! That's the answer!

03:01.781 --> 03:04.409
This is what I've been missing!

03:04.717 --> 03:10.349
What I really need to solve mysteries is
a faithful companion with a good nose!

03:11.591 --> 03:14.219
I wish I could have a dog too!

03:20.934 --> 03:23.562
Gee, dogs are pretty expensive.

03:25.438 --> 03:29.101
With my allowance, I could only
buy one of their tails.

03:29.409 --> 03:32.037
Still, it might be better than nothing.

03:33.746 --> 03:36.214
I can't do that, though, can I?

03:36.883 --> 03:40.182
I wonder if anyone's getting
rid of any puppies.

03:40.653 --> 03:42.621
Then I could be all...

03:43.356 --> 03:45.381
Nice work. You did a great job!

03:47.460 --> 03:51.089
Aah, I wish I had a dog.

03:59.906 --> 04:01.407
What was that?!

04:01.407 --> 04:04.706
A meteorite? Or was it a flying saucer?!

04:06.512 --> 04:08.139
A strange mystery!

04:14.454 --> 04:16.189
Where'd it go?!

04:16.189 --> 04:18.384
Where did my mystery land?

04:20.960 --> 04:23.520
What's that? Is it in there?

04:23.997 --> 04:26.833
Is it an alien? ET?

04:26.833 --> 04:28.960
Or maybe a skyfish?

04:35.908 --> 04:37.307
How cute!

04:41.047 --> 04:43.015
No means no!

04:43.349 --> 04:46.452
If it's taking care of him that's
the problem, I'll do it!

04:46.452 --> 04:48.588
I said no, and I mean it.

04:48.588 --> 04:51.056
We don't have time to be
taking care of some dog.

04:51.424 --> 04:52.914
No way...

04:56.462 --> 04:57.759
Mayura.

04:58.331 --> 05:00.099
At least give him some dinner.

05:00.099 --> 05:02.101
Does this mean I can keep him?!

05:02.101 --> 05:05.371
Just until we find him a new owner.

05:05.371 --> 05:07.032
Thanks, Dad!

05:55.221 --> 05:55.988
What's going on?

05:55.988 --> 05:56.222
A power failure?
What's going on?

05:56.222 --> 05:56.950
A power failure?

05:57.557 --> 05:58.524
A power failure?

06:16.109 --> 06:17.906
A puppy?

06:18.845 --> 06:21.814
Yeah. Would you mind letting me
take care of him here?

06:21.814 --> 06:24.183
My dad says I can't keep him at our house.

06:24.183 --> 06:26.913
Well, I don't know what
Master Loki will say.

06:29.155 --> 06:32.158
Don't forget we have already
have Ecchan here.

06:32.158 --> 06:33.455
Who's that?

06:33.893 --> 06:36.259
Ah, nothing! It's sort of an inside joke.

06:41.000 --> 06:42.661
So where is Loki?

06:43.336 --> 06:47.136
Master Loki is out investigating
a case right now.

06:47.573 --> 06:48.741
What?!

06:48.741 --> 06:51.811
And he didn't bring me along? No fair!

06:51.811 --> 06:54.780
He's trying to hog all the strange
mysteries for himself, isn't he?!

06:55.248 --> 06:59.552
Anyway, that's why I'm not sure if
we can take your dog in here.

06:59.552 --> 07:01.721
In any case, I've made some tea.

07:01.721 --> 07:05.418
I'm sorry, but the decision's
not mine to make, puppy.

07:08.494 --> 07:10.121
He's mad at me!

07:10.363 --> 07:13.764
Can this dog understand what I'm saying?

07:14.000 --> 07:16.628
It is now 12:00. Time for the
afternoon news update.

07:17.603 --> 07:20.206
The cause behind the
widespread power outage

07:20.206 --> 07:22.775
that occurred downtown last night
has yet to be determined.

07:22.775 --> 07:24.911
The electric company has assembled
an investigative committee,

07:24.911 --> 07:26.979
which is hastening to learn
the cause of the outage.

07:26.979 --> 07:28.446
Widespread power outage?

07:28.881 --> 07:30.750
You hadn't heard about it?

07:30.750 --> 07:34.049
The whole town was supposedly
in chaos last night.

07:34.320 --> 07:36.155
I had no idea.

07:36.155 --> 07:38.282
I was fast asleep all night.

07:38.758 --> 07:40.693
We go now to Mr. Takaya,
reporting live from

07:40.693 --> 07:43.296
a press conference being held
by the electric company.

07:43.296 --> 07:43.963
Some of the things that went out were
unrelated to the power supply.

07:43.963 --> 07:45.331
Yes. The press conference should be
getting underway in just a moment...
Some of the things that went out were
unrelated to the power supply.

07:45.331 --> 07:48.634
Yes. The press conference should be
getting underway in just a moment...
Car headlights and even the flames
from people's lighters...

07:48.634 --> 07:51.467
Everything you could call
"light" just went out.

07:51.704 --> 07:53.171
So that means...

07:53.539 --> 07:55.208
A mystery, correct?

07:55.208 --> 07:58.744
Master Loki said something about
this bothered him,

07:58.744 --> 08:01.047
so he's out investigating it now.

08:01.047 --> 08:03.883
Mayura, do you prefer one lump or...

08:03.883 --> 08:05.218
That's it!

08:05.218 --> 08:06.708
What is it, Mayura?

08:07.019 --> 08:10.716
I should solve this mystery with
the help of this little guy!

08:11.257 --> 08:14.460
If he helps solve the case and
becomes a great detective dog,

08:14.460 --> 08:16.951
maybe Loki won't have a problem
with keeping him here!

08:17.563 --> 08:19.428
A detective dog?

08:20.032 --> 08:23.269
Okay! Now that that's out of the way,
let's begin our investigation!

08:23.269 --> 08:24.702
Let's go, puppy!

08:45.191 --> 08:49.150
We've done a lot of walking,
but we still haven't found anything.

08:51.898 --> 08:53.099
What is it?

08:53.099 --> 08:55.294
Oh, I know! You found a clue, right?

08:58.104 --> 09:01.267
Nice work! You're the culprit!

09:01.340 --> 09:01.841
Imagawayaki

09:01.841 --> 09:05.311
imagawayaki
Welcome, welcome! I have some
delicious imagawayaki here.

09:05.311 --> 09:06.505
Imagawayaki
Narugami?!

09:09.315 --> 09:11.317
What are you doing here?

09:11.317 --> 09:14.020
Haven't you ever heard of imagawayaki?

09:14.020 --> 09:17.256
Supposedly, they were first sold
toward the end of the Edo era,

09:17.256 --> 09:19.986
in the Imagawa Bridge area of Kanda, Tokyo.

09:20.493 --> 09:23.257
Nowadays, they're filled with
red bean jam, chocolate or custard.

09:23.896 --> 09:28.230
Then there's my newest creation:
A spicy cod and miso filling!

09:32.772 --> 09:34.574
You just wanted to eat this?

09:34.574 --> 09:35.973
Oh, well.

09:36.509 --> 09:39.145
Do you want the custard cream?
Or the bean paste?

09:39.145 --> 09:40.203
An! (Paste!)

09:45.785 --> 09:49.915
Okay, we'll start our investigation
again once we finish these.

09:51.290 --> 09:53.087
Now what is it?

09:53.559 --> 09:56.896
Just remember, I don't have much of
this month's allowance left!

09:56.896 --> 09:58.363
You know that, don't you?!

10:01.534 --> 10:03.161
Where did you go?

10:16.749 --> 10:17.716
A power failure?

10:18.351 --> 10:20.785
What the?! I can't see a thing!

10:21.787 --> 10:23.254
Hey, puppy!

10:23.422 --> 10:24.719
Where are you?

10:31.797 --> 10:33.890
I wish I'd given him a name.

10:53.919 --> 10:55.354
Loki!

10:55.354 --> 10:57.083
Are you all right, Mayura?

10:57.456 --> 10:59.692
Well, we have work to do.

10:59.692 --> 11:01.660
You go on home.

11:02.828 --> 11:03.929
Uh, um...

11:03.929 --> 11:05.556
Let's go, Yamino.

11:05.965 --> 11:07.133
Yes, sir!

11:07.133 --> 11:09.260
It's dark, so be careful.

11:09.769 --> 11:11.066
Uh...

11:14.040 --> 11:17.143
It appears we're dealing with a
rather troublesome opponent.

11:17.143 --> 11:18.132
Yeah.

11:29.855 --> 11:31.357
I knew it.

11:31.357 --> 11:33.825
It's the wolf that consumes moonlight.

11:34.160 --> 11:35.559
It's Hati.

11:57.983 --> 11:59.985
Lights have been going out around town

11:59.985 --> 12:02.288
because this thing has been
absorbing it all up, correct?

12:02.288 --> 12:04.423
We'll have to save that conversation
for later, Yamino!

12:04.423 --> 12:05.720
So it would seem.

12:22.908 --> 12:25.376
Are we to take that as a courtesy call?

12:26.345 --> 12:29.982
Hati chases the moon, while
Skoll pursues the sun.

12:29.982 --> 12:32.118
In that way, day changes to night and back.

12:32.118 --> 12:34.754
Lunar eclipses occur when
Hati swallows the moon,

12:34.754 --> 12:37.723
and solar eclipses when
Skoll swallows the sun.

12:38.390 --> 12:41.994
During an eclipse, people bang pots
and pans to startle the wolves

12:41.994 --> 12:44.724
into spitting the sun or
moon back up, right?

12:45.231 --> 12:49.190
If he can be beaten with a pot,
then this shouldn't be much trouble.

12:49.468 --> 12:52.335
I looked up the locations where
the power failures occurred.

12:57.209 --> 12:58.608
Interesting, isn't it?

13:05.451 --> 13:07.078
I'm back.

13:07.620 --> 13:09.588
Were you able to find your puppy?

13:10.890 --> 13:12.414
I see.

13:13.259 --> 13:16.490
I hope he wasn't taken in by a
bad person or something.

13:17.296 --> 13:19.127
Huh? What's that?

13:19.865 --> 13:22.163
The locations of all the power failures.

13:24.603 --> 13:27.902
That's the place where I found the puppy.

13:29.975 --> 13:32.244
Come to think of it,

13:32.244 --> 13:35.614
that was the same time I saw
something fall from the sky.

13:35.614 --> 13:36.911
Really?

13:37.149 --> 13:39.344
So this is a mystery!

13:48.027 --> 13:50.655
I wonder what kind of aliens we'll encounter.

13:51.197 --> 13:53.825
Maybe some greys.
They're the most famous type!

13:54.700 --> 13:57.736
Some aliens are more famous than others?

13:57.736 --> 13:59.033
Who knows.

13:59.371 --> 14:01.168
Um, Mayura?

14:02.374 --> 14:04.043
What is that?

14:04.043 --> 14:05.340
Oh, this?

14:05.644 --> 14:07.279
It's dog food!

14:07.279 --> 14:11.909
After all, the aliens might be hungry, right?

14:12.284 --> 14:16.084
I don't think any aliens will be
coming out for dog food.

14:19.091 --> 14:20.718
What is this?!

14:28.400 --> 14:30.236
Is it a crater?

14:30.236 --> 14:33.000
A UFO fell here, right?

14:39.345 --> 14:42.678
What's going on? It's still the
middle of the afternoon!

14:47.987 --> 14:49.955
An eclipse?

14:50.823 --> 14:52.222
No way...

14:58.664 --> 14:59.832
Be careful!

14:59.832 --> 15:00.924
Right.

15:10.042 --> 15:10.872
Mayura!

15:11.010 --> 15:11.874
Mayura!

15:17.049 --> 15:19.218
It looks like she's safe, somehow.

15:19.218 --> 15:22.415
It would seem that her helmet
isn't merely for show.

15:23.589 --> 15:26.217
Yamino! It's time to get serious.

15:28.160 --> 15:29.252
Here it comes.

15:45.311 --> 15:46.278
Master Loki!

15:47.046 --> 15:48.380
I'm all right.

15:48.380 --> 15:49.915
It's nothing serious.

15:49.915 --> 15:51.542
How dare you strike Master Loki?!

15:54.586 --> 15:58.886
It would seem that I'll have
to go all out too.

17:04.289 --> 17:06.723
It's Skoll, the wolf who swallows the sun.

17:07.726 --> 17:10.024
So he was here after all, eh?

17:16.635 --> 17:17.693
Father!

17:30.082 --> 17:31.743
Hey there, Fenrir!

17:31.950 --> 17:33.212
Daddy!

17:33.419 --> 17:35.546
It can't be! My older brother?!

17:44.530 --> 17:47.633
How dare you bare your fangs at my daddy?

17:47.633 --> 17:51.160
I'll see that you repent of
your mistake in Hell!

18:51.096 --> 18:55.294
It would seem that he is
really trying to kill me.

18:56.835 --> 19:00.532
Even more powerful assassins
are sure to follow.

19:04.810 --> 19:08.337
If I'd known this would happen,
we could've just ridden Gullinbursti.

19:10.616 --> 19:12.518
There's nothing we can do
about it now, is there?

19:12.518 --> 19:16.511
This railroad crossing gets a lot
of traffic around this time.

19:17.256 --> 19:21.659
If we don't hurry, that special on
watermelons will be over!

19:25.531 --> 19:27.795
All right! We have to hurry, Heimdall!

19:28.200 --> 19:31.499
One person can carry up to three,
so the both of us can buy six!

19:36.642 --> 19:39.167
Daddy! I've missed you so much!

19:39.645 --> 19:41.413
There, there!

19:41.413 --> 19:44.849
I bet you were lonely.
It must've been so hard on you!

19:45.517 --> 19:47.041
I'm back!

19:47.452 --> 19:49.249
Ah, it's Mayura.

19:49.755 --> 19:52.553
You just wait here.
I'll get you your dinner soon.

19:55.661 --> 19:58.897
You're such a cruel person, I mean dog.

19:58.897 --> 20:02.367
How was I to have known it was you
when you look like that?

20:02.367 --> 20:03.334
Brother?

20:03.635 --> 20:07.594
Aw, man. I get so nervous
in front of the old man.

20:08.607 --> 20:11.440
Hey, my tail's kinda cramped.
Give it a massage, will ya?

20:12.311 --> 20:15.906
Oh, Fenrir! You've been out who knows
where doing who knows what!

20:16.515 --> 20:21.646
Yeah, right! I was chained up in that
cold-ass place the whole time!

20:22.087 --> 20:26.751
Next time I see that bastard Odin,
I'm gonna hide his shoes!

20:27.326 --> 20:30.557
But how did you manage to get here?

20:31.096 --> 20:34.463
Heck if I know. My chain just
broke all of a sudden.

20:34.900 --> 20:39.838
You mean Gleipnir, the chain they say
is indestructible, broke?

20:39.838 --> 20:41.237
But how?

20:41.707 --> 20:45.302
How would I know, you slack-jawed
little daddy's boy?!

20:45.911 --> 20:47.246
Sorry to keep you waiting!

20:47.246 --> 20:49.043
We went and bought some dog food!

20:49.481 --> 20:52.041
Ah, Daddy! Welcome home!

20:52.417 --> 20:54.544
Which of us is a daddy's boy again?

20:57.723 --> 20:59.691
Yes, I know!

21:00.926 --> 21:04.418
It makes me wonder if those gods
really are so lacking in strength.

21:05.797 --> 21:08.400
Oh, there's no cause for concern!

21:08.400 --> 21:12.359
We are on a far different level than that lot.

21:14.439 --> 21:18.808
We will carry out Loki's assassination as
you have commanded, Lord Odin.

21:19.111 --> 21:22.672
Leave it in the hands of us Norns,
the goddesses of fate.

21:31.423 --> 21:35.827
We didn't end up finding any
meteorites or flying saucers...

21:35.827 --> 21:38.864
But we got a cute, little pet,
so that's good enough!

21:38.864 --> 21:40.966
He's not our pet, for crying out loud.

21:40.966 --> 21:42.834
Huh? How mean!

21:42.834 --> 21:45.771
You said that you'd take care of him here!

21:45.771 --> 21:47.398
You're a liar!

21:48.073 --> 21:50.242
Fenrir's not a pet.

21:50.242 --> 21:52.369
He's family.

21:53.412 --> 21:55.039
That's right.

21:55.347 --> 21:57.645
All right! Thank you so much, Loki!

22:16.768 --> 22:28.737
Fukai kiri wo saite tsukiakari ga terashita michi

22:30.415 --> 22:42.160
Daremo mina mayoinagara,
samayotteru ashita e to

22:42.160 --> 22:49.368
Kodoku no machi de kataritsugu shinwa sae

22:49.368 --> 22:55.707
Habamaresou na yami wo nukete yuku

22:55.707 --> 23:05.217
Hatenai sora wo koete tabi wo shite iru

23:05.217 --> 23:09.554
Kizutsuitemo

23:09.554 --> 23:21.566
Boku-tachi wa kitto tadoritsukeru kara,
inori-tsuzuketai

23:21.566 --> 23:23.295
Believe in Heaven

23:31.143 --> 23:32.310
Next Episode

23:32.310 --> 23:35.647
Next Episode
The key words for the next episode are
"mirror," "fortune-telling" and "three sisters."

23:35.647 --> 23:36.481
Next Episode
Umm...

23:36.481 --> 23:38.483
Next Episode
What is it, my pretty young lady?

23:38.483 --> 23:40.318
Next Episode
I get weak in the knees when
you stare at me like that!

23:40.318 --> 23:42.954
Next Episode
Is that right? Then I'll look
that way while I talk.

23:42.954 --> 23:44.256
Next Episode
"That way"? Which way?

23:44.256 --> 23:46.425
Next Episode
Good question. You decide.

23:46.425 --> 23:48.260
Next Episode
Ah, you're looking at me like that again!

23:48.260 --> 23:51.696
Next Episode
Oh, sorry about that.
Okay, I'll look this way.

23:51.696 --> 23:53.031
Next Episode
So what did you want?

23:53.031 --> 23:54.933
Next Episode
Me? Uh... pickled kelp!

23:54.933 --> 23:55.967
Next Episode
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.967 --> 23:56.568
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.568 --> 23:56.668
"The Beautiful Assassins"

23:56.668 --> 23:58.203
The 15th Night
The Beautiful Assassins
"The Beautiful Assassins"

23:58.203 --> 24:00.038
The 15th Night
The Beautiful Assassins
Another strange mystery!

24:00.038 --> 24:01.005
The 15th Night
The Beautiful Assassins
